{"seq":2,"slug":"chunked-resumable-upload","title":"分片与断点续传","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-file-upload-streaming/upload-fundamentals/chunked-resumable-upload","wordCount":1688,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"分片与断点续传\">分片与断点续传</h1><p>当文件体积超过数百 MB、网络环境不稳定、或用户随时可能中断操作时，一次性上传不再可行。分片上传将大文件拆成固定大小的 chunk 独立传输，每个 chunk 独立确认，失败时只需重传该 chunk 而非整个文件。断点续传在此基础上增加了进度持久化——即使浏览器关闭或设备重启，下次打开时仍能从上次断点继续。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>分片（Chunk/Part）</strong>：将大文件按固定大小切割为独立传输单元，每片独立确认和重试</li>\n<li><strong>上传会话（Upload Session）</strong>：服务端为一次分片上传分配的标识符（uploadId），关联所有分片状态</li>\n<li><strong>断点续传</strong>：通过持久化已完成分片的偏移量，允许中断后从断点继续而非重头开始</li>\n<li><strong>TUS 协议</strong>：基于 HTTP 的开放断点续传标准，正在 IETF 标准化为 <code>draft-ietf-httpbis-resumable-upload</code></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"分片上传的协议模型\">分片上传的协议模型</h2><p>分片上传的生命周期包含三个阶段：初始化、分片传输、完成合并。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant C as 客户端&#10;    participant S as 服务端&#10;    participant Store as 对象存储&#10;&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;S: POST /uploads (创建上传会话)&#10;    S-&gt;&gt;Store: CreateMultipartUpload&#10;    Store--&gt;&gt;S: uploadId&#10;    S--&gt;&gt;C: 200 {uploadId, chunkSize}&#10;&#10;    loop 每个分片&#10;        C-&gt;&gt;S: PUT /uploads/{uploadId}/parts/{partNum}&#10;        S-&gt;&gt;Store: UploadPart(uploadId, partNum, body)&#10;        Store--&gt;&gt;S: ETag&#10;        S--&gt;&gt;C: 200 {partNum, etag}&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;S: POST /uploads/{uploadId}/complete&#10;    S-&gt;&gt;Store: CompleteMultipartUpload(parts[])&#10;    Store--&gt;&gt;S: 最终对象 URL&#10;    S--&gt;&gt;C: 200 {url, size, checksum}\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant C as 客户端\n    participant S as 服务端\n    participant Store as 对象存储\n\n    C-&gt;&gt;S: POST /uploads (创建上传会话)\n    S-&gt;&gt;Store: CreateMultipartUpload\n    Store--&gt;&gt;S: uploadId\n    S--&gt;&gt;C: 200 {uploadId, chunkSize}\n\n    loop 每个分片\n        C-&gt;&gt;S: PUT /uploads/{uploadId}/parts/{partNum}\n        S-&gt;&gt;Store: UploadPart(uploadId, partNum, body)\n        Store--&gt;&gt;S: ETag\n        S--&gt;&gt;C: 200 {partNum, etag}\n    end\n\n    C-&gt;&gt;S: POST /uploads/{uploadId}/complete\n    S-&gt;&gt;Store: CompleteMultipartUpload(parts[])\n    Store--&gt;&gt;S: 最终对象 URL\n    S--&gt;&gt;C: 200 {url, size, checksum}</pre><h2 id=\"分片大小的选择\">分片大小的选择</h2><p>分片大小直接影响并发度、重传成本和元数据开销三个维度。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分片大小</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>劣势</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>5 MB</td>\n<td>分片粒度细，重传代价小</td>\n<td>分片数多（1GB = 200 片），元数据管理复杂</td>\n<td>弱网移动端</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>16 MB</td>\n<td>平衡选择</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>通用 Web 应用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>64 MB</td>\n<td>减少请求数和元数据开销</td>\n<td>单片失败重传代价高</td>\n<td>高速内网、大文件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>100+ MB</td>\n<td>吞吐量最大化</td>\n<td>不适合弱网</td>\n<td>数据迁移、服务端到服务端</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>AWS S3 的硬限制：单个分片最小 5 MB（最后一片除外），最大 5 GB，总分片数上限 10,000。因此 5 MB 分片最多支持 ~50 GB 文件，要上传 5 TB 文件需使用 ≥500 MB 分片。</p>\n<p>2026 年 4 月 AWS 宣布 S3 新增支持 CRC64NVME 等十种校验算法，分片上传支持 <code>FULL_OBJECT</code> 级别校验——不再限于 per-part 的 composite 校验。这意味着完成合并时可以验证整个对象的端到端完整性：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>checksum</mtext><mtext>full</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mtext>CRC64NVME</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mtext>part</mtext><mn>1</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><msub><mtext>part</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><mo>⋯</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∥</mi><msub><mtext>part</mtext><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{checksum}_{\\text{full}} = \\text{CRC64NVME}(\\text{part}_1 \\| \\text{part}_2 \\| \\cdots \\| \\text{part}_n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">checksum</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">full</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CRC64NVME</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">part</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">part</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">⋯</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∥</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">part</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0573em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><h2 id=\"tus-协议-开放的断点续传标准\">TUS 协议：开放的断点续传标准</h2><p>TUS（tus.io）是一个基于 HTTP 的开放断点续传协议，2025 年其核心规范已提交 IETF 作为 <code>draft-ietf-httpbis-resumable-upload</code>，目前处于 WGLC（Working Group Last Call）阶段。</p>\n<h3 id=\"核心交互流程\">核心交互流程</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"http\" data-code=\"# 1. 创建上传资源&#10;POST /files HTTP/1.1&#10;Tus-Resumable: 1.0.0&#10;Upload-Length: 104857600&#10;Upload-Metadata: filename d29ybGQucG5n,type aW1hZ2UvcG5n&#10;&#10;HTTP/1.1 201 Created&#10;Location: /files/24e533e02ec3bc40c387f1a0e460e216&#10;&#10;# 2. 查询当前偏移&#10;HEAD /files/24e533e02ec3bc40c387f1a0e460e216 HTTP/1.1&#10;Tus-Resumable: 1.0.0&#10;&#10;HTTP/1.1 200 OK&#10;Upload-Offset: 35262432&#10;&#10;# 3. 从偏移处续传&#10;PATCH /files/24e533e02ec3bc40c387f1a0e460e216 HTTP/1.1&#10;Tus-Resumable: 1.0.0&#10;Upload-Offset: 35262432&#10;Content-Type: application/offset+octet-stream&#10;Content-Length: 69595168&#10;&#10;&lt;binary data from offset&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 1. 创建上传资源</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>POST /files HTTP/1.1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Tus-Resumable: 1.0.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Upload-Length: 104857600</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Upload-Metadata: filename d29ybGQucG5n,type aW1hZ2UvcG5n</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>HTTP/1.1 201 Created</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Location: /files/24e533e02ec3bc40c387f1a0e460e216</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 2. 查询当前偏移</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>HEAD /files/24e533e02ec3bc40c387f1a0e460e216 HTTP/1.1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Tus-Resumable: 1.0.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>HTTP/1.1 200 OK</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Upload-Offset: 35262432</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 3. 从偏移处续传</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>PATCH /files/24e533e02ec3bc40c387f1a0e460e216 HTTP/1.1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Tus-Resumable: 1.0.0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Upload-Offset: 35262432</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Content-Type: application/offset+octet-stream</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Content-Length: 69595168</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>&#x3C;binary data from offset></span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"tus-扩展机制\">TUS 扩展机制</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>扩展</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Creation</td>\n<td>创建上传资源</td>\n<td>基础必选</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Creation-With-Upload</td>\n<td>创建时附带首片数据</td>\n<td>减少一次 RTT</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Expiration</td>\n<td>服务端声明资源过期时间</td>\n<td>自动清理未完成上传</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Checksum</td>\n<td>每 PATCH 附带校验值</td>\n<td>数据完整性验证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Concatenation</td>\n<td>并行上传后合并</td>\n<td>超大文件加速</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Termination</td>\n<td>客户端主动取消</td>\n<td>释放服务端资源</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"ietf-标准化进展-2025-2026\">IETF 标准化进展（2025-2026）</h3><p>IETF httpbis 工作组的 <code>draft-ietf-httpbis-resumable-upload</code> 基于 TUS 的生产经验提出了标准化方案。与 TUS 1.0 的主要差异：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>使用 <code>104 Upload Resumption Supported</code> 信息性响应声明服务端能力</li>\n<li>上传资源 URI 在 interim 和 final 响应中通告</li>\n<li>服务端必须声明限制（limits），客户端必须遵守</li>\n<li>已有 Apple URLSession（iOS/macOS）、tus-js-client、tusd（Go）、tusdotnet（.NET）等实现</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"服务端状态管理\">服务端状态管理</h2><p>断点续传要求服务端持久化每个上传会话的进度。状态存储的选型直接影响系统的可靠性与水平扩展能力。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>存储方案</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>劣势</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Redis</td>\n<td>读写快、天然 TTL</td>\n<td>重启丢数据（需 AOF/RDB）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PostgreSQL/MySQL</td>\n<td>事务保证、持久化</td>\n<td>高频更新时写压力大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对象存储元数据</td>\n<td>直接与文件绑定</td>\n<td>查询灵活性差</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>文件系统 .meta 文件</td>\n<td>简单、无外部依赖</td>\n<td>不支持多实例共享</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>生产推荐：Redis 做热状态（高频更新 offset），定期同步到 DB 做持久化备份。上传完成后删除 Redis 记录。</p>\n<h2 id=\"并发分片上传\">并发分片上传</h2><p>客户端可以并行上传多个分片以提升总吞吐量。但需注意：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>并发度限制</strong>：浏览器对同一域名的 HTTP/1.1 并发连接数限制为 6；HTTP/2 多路复用后理论上限更高，但服务端需控制并发避免内存压力</li>\n<li><strong>乱序到达</strong>：分片可能乱序到达，服务端必须按 partNumber 索引而非到达顺序</li>\n<li><strong>重复上传</strong>：网络重试可能导致同一分片被上传多次，服务端需实现幂等（相同 partNumber 覆盖写入）</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"async function uploadParallel(file: File, chunkSize: number, concurrency: number, uploadId: string) {&#10;  const totalParts = Math.ceil(file.size / chunkSize);&#10;  const parts: PartResult[] = [];&#10;  const queue = new PQueue({ concurrency });&#10;&#10;  for (let i = 0; i &lt; totalParts; i++) {&#10;    queue.add(async () =&gt; {&#10;      const start = i * chunkSize;&#10;      const end = Math.min(start + chunkSize, file.size);&#10;      const blob = file.slice(start, end);&#10;      const result = await uploadPart(uploadId, i + 1, blob);&#10;      parts[i] = result;&#10;    });&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  await queue.onIdle();&#10;  return parts;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> uploadParallel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">file</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> File</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">chunkSize</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">concurrency</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">uploadId</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> totalParts</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ceil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(file.size </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> chunkSize);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> parts</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PartResult</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> queue</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PQueue</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ concurrency });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> totalParts; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    queue.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">add</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> start</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> chunkSize;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> end</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">min</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(start </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> chunkSize, file.size);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> blob</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> file.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">slice</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(start, end);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> uploadPart</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(uploadId, i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, blob);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      parts[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> queue.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">onIdle</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> parts;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"失败恢复与超时清理\">失败恢复与超时清理</h2><h3 id=\"分片级重试\">分片级重试</h3><p>单个分片上传失败时，客户端应实现带指数退避的重试逻辑。重试上限建议 3-5 次，超过后标记该上传为失败并通知用户。</p>\n<h3 id=\"服务端超时清理\">服务端超时清理</h3><p>未完成的上传会话占用存储空间。需要定时清理机制：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>S3 提供 <code>AbortIncompleteMultipartUpload</code> 生命周期规则，可设置 N 天后自动清理</li>\n<li>自建服务应设置会话过期时间（如 24 小时），由定时任务扫描并清理过期会话及其已上传的分片</li>\n</ul>\n<p>关于生命周期策略的完整讨论，参见 <a href=\"../storage-integration/storage-strategy-lifecycle\">存储策略与生命周期管理</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"s3-multipart-upload-的最新改进\">S3 Multipart Upload 的最新改进</h2><p>2024-2026 年间 AWS S3 对分片上传做了多项增强：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>条件写入（2024-08）</strong>：<code>CompleteMultipartUpload</code> 支持 <code>IfNoneMatch</code> 头，实现 compare-and-swap 语义，防止并发覆盖</li>\n<li><strong>全对象校验（2025-01）</strong>：新增 <code>ChecksumType: FULL_OBJECT</code> 和 <code>MpuObjectSize</code> 参数，完成合并时验证整个对象的 CRC</li>\n<li><strong>十种校验算法（2026-04）</strong>：新增 MD5、XXHash3、XXHash64、XXHash128、SHA-512，总计支持十种算法</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这些改进使得分片上传在数据完整性保障上与单次 PutObject 达到同等水平，消除了过去「分片上传无法验证全对象完整性」的痛点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"选型决策树\">选型决策树</h2><p>在 <a href=\"multipart-upload-protocols\">Multipart 上传协议</a> 的基础上，以下决策树帮助选择是否需要分片续传：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>文件 ≤ 50 MB 且网络稳定 → 标准 Multipart 表单上传</li>\n<li>文件 &gt; 50 MB 或网络不稳定 → 分片上传 + 断点续传</li>\n<li>需要跨平台标准化 → TUS 协议</li>\n<li>AWS 生态内 → S3 Multipart Upload API</li>\n<li>需要 IETF 标准合规 → <code>draft-ietf-httpbis-resumable-upload</code> 实现</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>分片与断点续传将大文件上传从「全有或全无」的原子操作转变为可增量推进的渐进过程。关键工程决策包括：分片大小选择（平衡重传成本与请求数开销）、会话状态持久化方案（Redis 热状态 + DB 冷备）、并发分片策略（利用 HTTP/2 多路复用）。TUS 协议正在 IETF 标准化，将成为跨平台断点续传的工业标准。2026 年 S3 的 FULL_OBJECT 校验能力消除了分片上传在完整性验证上的历史短板。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"分片与断点续传","id":"分片与断点续传"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"分片上传的协议模型","id":"分片上传的协议模型"},{"level":2,"text":"分片大小的选择","id":"分片大小的选择"},{"level":2,"text":"TUS 协议：开放的断点续传标准","id":"tus-协议-开放的断点续传标准"},{"level":3,"text":"核心交互流程","id":"核心交互流程"},{"level":3,"text":"TUS 扩展机制","id":"tus-扩展机制"},{"level":3,"text":"IETF 标准化进展（2025-2026）","id":"ietf-标准化进展-2025-2026"},{"level":2,"text":"服务端状态管理","id":"服务端状态管理"},{"level":2,"text":"并发分片上传","id":"并发分片上传"},{"level":2,"text":"失败恢复与超时清理","id":"失败恢复与超时清理"},{"level":3,"text":"分片级重试","id":"分片级重试"},{"level":3,"text":"服务端超时清理","id":"服务端超时清理"},{"level":2,"text":"S3 Multipart Upload 的最新改进","id":"s3-multipart-upload-的最新改进"},{"level":2,"text":"选型决策树","id":"选型决策树"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Multipart 上传协议与实现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-file-upload-streaming/upload-fundamentals/multipart-upload-protocols"},"next":{"title":"预签名 URL 与客户端直传","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/backend-file-upload-streaming/upload-fundamentals/presigned-url-direct-upload"}}